{"id":"word:hebrew:H1065","type":"word","title":"בְּכִי","subtitle":"H1065 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a weeping ; by analogy, a dripping","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בְּכִי (H1065) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 28 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בְּכִי (Bᵉkîy) means a weeping ; by analogy, a dripping First listed occurrence: 2Sam 13 36."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בְּכִי","transliteration":"Bᵉkîy","pronunciation":"bek-ee'","strong":"H1065","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1065","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["בְּכִ֖י","בְּכִ֣י","בְּכִ֥י","בְכִ֖י","וּ/בְכִ֖י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",9],["HR/Ncmsa",9],["HNcmsc",3],["HRd/Ncmsa",2],["HR/Ncmsc",2],["HC/Ncmsa",1],["HC/R/Ncmsa",1],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a weeping ; by analogy, a dripping","usage":"overflowing, × sore, (continual) weeping, wept.","full":"H1065. beki בְּכִי noun masculine Judg 21:2 weeping — בְּכִי 21:2 20 t. (also construct Deut 34:8 , etc.); בִּבְכִ֑י Gen 45:2 ; בֶּ֑כִי Isa 15:2 6 t.; suffix בִּכְִיי֑ Psa 6:9 ; &#8212; weeping 30:6 ; Isa 15:2 , 5 ; as accusative of congnate meaning with verb (with בכה ) Judg 21:2 ; 2Sam 13:36 ; 2Kin 20:3 = Isa 38:3 compare 16:9 ( בבכי ) Jer 48:32 ( מבכי ); audible ב ׳קול Psa 6:9 ; Isa 65:19 ; Ezra 3:13 compare Jer 3:21 ; 31:16 ; Isa 15:3 ( בבכי יֹרֵד ייליל see Jer 9:17 ); so also Gen 45:2 ( בב אתקֿלו ׳ויתן ) & Jer 48:5 ( בכי יעלה בבכי i.e. the sound of it shall ascend) — but text here suspicious, compare Isa 15:5 ; as disfiguring Job 16:16 ; || words of mourning Est 4:3 ( מִסְמֵּד צוֺם, אֵבֶל, ), Jer 31:9 ( תחנונים compare 3:21 ), 9:10 ; 31:15 ( נהי ), compare משׁה אבל בכי Deut 34:8 & Di on the passage ; cotrition (humiliation) Joel 2:12 ( מִסְמֵּד צום, ), Isa 22:12 ( שׂק חגור קרחה, מספד, ), compare Mal 2:13 ( דמעה אנקה, ); of bitter weeping Isa 22:4 בַּבֶּ֑כִי אֲמָרֵר , compare Jer 31:15 (& Isa 33:7 ); יעזר בכי 16:9 ; Jer 48:32 i.e. Ya`zer in Moab, compare יעזר proper name; Psa 102:10 ( בב ׳שׁקוי מסכתי compare 42:4 ; 80:6 & Babylonian dîmtu maštîtî , tears ( were ) my drink Zim BP 34, 42 ). Trop., of trickling streams ( נהרות ) in mines — hindrance to miners Job 28:11 .","rootNote":"from 1058 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Sam 13 36","keyReferences":["2Sam 13 36","Deut 34 8","Esth 4 3","Ezra 3 13","Gen 45 2","Isa 15 2","Isa 15 3","Isa 15 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":28,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Sam 13 36","book":"2Sam","chapter":13,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּכִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 34 8","book":"Deut","chapter":34,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְכִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Esth 4 3","book":"Esth","chapter":4,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְכִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Ezra 3 13","book":"Ezra","chapter":3,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּכִ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Gen 45 2","book":"Gen","chapter":45,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִּ/בְכִ֑י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 15 2","book":"Isa","chapter":15,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/בֶ֑כִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 15 3","book":"Isa","chapter":15,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בֶּֽכִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 15 5","book":"Isa","chapter":15,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִּ/בְכִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Isa 16 9","book":"Isa","chapter":16,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בִּ/בְכִ֤י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Isa 22 4","book":"Isa","chapter":22,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בֶּ֑כִי"